---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import aboutImage from '../assets/site/about.jpg';
import { site } from '../site.config';

// SAMPLE copy: replace the story below with your own words.
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`The story behind ${site.name}: crochet pieces made slowly and by hand.`}
  image={aboutImage}
>
  <PageHeader title="Made slowly, on purpose." eyebrow={`About ${site.name}`} colour="mint">
    <p class="page-lede">
      {site.name} is a small crochet studio. Every piece is made by hand, one stitch after another, with yarn chosen for how
      it feels as much as how it looks.
    </p>
  </PageHeader>

  <section class="wrap about-story" aria-label="Our story">
    <div class="about-photo mount yarn-marigold">
      <Image
        src={aboutImage}
        alt={site.sitePhotos.about.alt}
        widths={[480, 720, 960, 1200]}
        sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 48vw, 100vw"
        priority
        class="about-img"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        Every piece in the shop starts the same way: a hook, a ball of yarn and an idea. Some become cuddly toys, some
        become bags and hats, and some become the little things that make a home feel softer.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nothing here comes off a production line. A small toy can take an evening and a blanket can take weeks. That time
        shows in the details: even stitches, parts that are sewn on securely, and finishing you can feel.
      </p>
      <p>Because everything is made by hand, your piece may differ slightly from the photos. We think that's what makes it yours.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="values-title">
    <h2 id="values-title" class="display section-title">What goes into every piece</h2>
    <ul class="values" role="list">
      <li class="yarn-coral">
        <h3>Yarn that feels good</h3>
        <p>Soft cotton for anything that touches skin, and sturdier blends for bags and toys that get carried everywhere.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="yarn-teal">
        <h3>Made to last</h3>
        <p>Toys have securely fixed or embroidered eyes, seams are sewn tight, and every loose end is woven in properly.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="yarn-lilac">
        <h3>Honest timelines</h3>
        <p>Ready-to-ship pieces go out within days. Made-to-order pieces get a realistic date before you pay.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap about-cta" aria-labelledby="about-cta-title">
    <h2 id="about-cta-title" class="display section-title">Come and have a look around</h2>
    <div class="about-cta-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/shop/">Shop all pieces</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact/">Say hello</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-story {
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-top: clamp(2.75rem, 2rem + 3vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .about-story {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .about-photo :global(.about-img) {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .about-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 36rem;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .values {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .values {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .values li {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.1rem;
    border-top: 5px solid var(--yarn-bright);
  }

  .values h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .values p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .about-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
